I have to say, on the list of all the crazy things we did the week before our wedding, assembling over 100 welcome boxes for all of our wedding guests, and HAND-DELIVERING them, has to be right at the top. What were we thinking LOL?! 😂🤍

All jokes aside, this was probably one of my favourite parts of the lead-up to the wedding. Getting to curate a box of all of my favourite, local, value-led brands, and share them with the people who mean the most to me in this world… seriously, what a dream!

